{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block title %}SMS Terms{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="page-wrapper">
  {% include "partials/topbar.njk" %}
  {% set title = "SMS Terms" %}
  {% include "partials/page-title.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/permanents.njk" %}

  <section class="feature-section page-wrapper-two ptb-120">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 13, 2026</p>

          <h2>Freeny Enterprise LLC Booking Updates</h2>
          <p>These terms apply to the booking-related text messaging program offered by Freeny Enterprise LLC
            (“Freeny Enterprise,” “we,” “us,” or “our”). By checking the SMS consent box and providing your mobile
            number, you agree to receive text messages about your booking, such as reservation updates and related
            service communications.</p>

          <h3>Message frequency and charges</h3>
          <p>Message frequency varies based on your booking and interactions with us. Message and data rates may apply
            according to your wireless plan. Your mobile carrier’s rates may apply to messages sent to you and by you.</p>

          <h3>Opt out or get help</h3>
          <p>You can stop text messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>. After opting out, you will receive
            a confirmation message and will not receive further program messages unless you opt in again. For help,
            reply <strong>HELP</strong>, call us at <a href="tel:7035991585">703-599-1585</a>, or email
            <a href="mailto:contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com">contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com</a>.</p>

          <h3>Consent and delivery</h3>
          <p>Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing or renting from us. Wireless carriers
            are not responsible for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery depends on your carrier and
            network availability.</p>

          <h3>Privacy</h3>
          <p>We use your mobile number and SMS consent to send the booking-related messages you requested and to manage
            your messaging preferences. We do not sell or share your mobile number or SMS consent with third parties
            or affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes. Service providers that help us deliver or
            support messages may process this information only to provide those services. See our
            <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a> for more information.</p>

          <h3>Contact</h3>
          <p>Questions about these terms? Contact Freeny Enterprise LLC at
            <a href="tel:7035991585">703-599-1585</a> or
            <a href="mailto:contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com">contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
</div>
{% endblock %}
